{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t陳茂波在國際金融領袖投資峰會致辭時表示，香港在「一國兩制」框架下，與內地緊密相連，憑藉普通法制度、資本自由流動以及國際化網絡，讓企業和投資者聯繫起來。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n他又說，香港將繼續提升市場效率，包括加快審批及精簡程序等，但不會犠牲市場誠信。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:05:28.561045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:48:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:38:53.723297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:41.643249+00:00","content_hash":"4b28d96cbc53cb9608958fcb39c5c0729fea978899e87929313d7cc0505ff756","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}